# Apps Layer Visibility

In `apps/` (API, worker), use the TypeScript `private` access modifier. Do not use `#` private fields or methods.

```typescript
// ✅
private async authenticate(context: ExecutionContext, next: CallHandler): Promise<unknown> {}

// ❌
async #authenticate(context: ExecutionContext, next: CallHandler): Promise<unknown> {}
```

Packages may still use `#` where they already do (for example nest-http filters).
